// PENDING: from an OPEN SigmaHQ pull request. Not reviewed or merged by SigmaHQ yet.
// Pull request: #6613 new: RevStealer rules (C2 domain, gate URI, Telegraph and Polygon dead drops, renamed OneDrive host)
// Pull request URL: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/pull/6613
// Pull request author: harperjohnsai
// Change: new rule
// Title: Renamed OneDrive Client Execution
// Sigma ID: 8e3a9d39-ba97-4649-9c6d-6628e4d9991f
// Status: experimental | Level: medium
// Author: Harper Johns
// Date: 2026-11-13 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: stealth, T1036.003
// Description: Detects execution of a binary whose PE OriginalFileName is OneDrive.exe but whose file name is
//   not OneDrive.exe. Adversaries rename signed Microsoft binaries to side-load malicious DLLs. For
//   example, in the "Setup Center" campaign that delivers RevStealer (REF2859), the Microsoft-signed
//   OneDrive client is renamed Installer.exe and shipped next to a malicious proxy version.dll that
//   is side-loaded by it. The rule is derived from static reversing of the sample, not from observed
//   telemetry.
// False positives:
//   - Software that bundles and renames the OneDrive client (uncommon)
// References:
//   - https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/threat-command/revstealer-credential-harvesting-infostealer
//   - https://bazaar.abuse.ch/sample/2e3bdd68f85755b02caa42ec0228fb8a56c964479c4f085eae67569d67440e49/
//   - https://bazaar.abuse.ch/sample/b371d2e01562fc0d29072ac1a56969628b6408f2368c056c3158f4fe0c609960/
//   - https://github.com/harperjohnsai/detections/blob/d8423a700dadfffe1369e23462940bd3c9d91b36/iocs/2026-11-revstealer-setup-center/README.md
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/a93182fab1253978eef4eb2357ee4d42e8d1a2d0/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_renamed_onedrive.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language, Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where ProcessVersionInfoOriginalFileName =~ "OneDrive.exe" and (not(FolderPath endswith "\\OneDrive.exe"))
